gory domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\\\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Digital Asset Treasury]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Regulation]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/\\\">News</category>\\n    </item>\\n    <item>\\n      <title><![CDATA[Here's why bitcoin turned lower from the 200-day average]]></title>\\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/bitcoin-s-rebound-has-a-buyer-problem-as-etf-coinbase-and-korea-demand-fade</link>\\n      <media:content url=\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/3b0bfccd5147a8f177d1f34c3e42fa47580e6cd2-1920x1280.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\\\" type=\\\"image/*\\\" medium=\\\"image\\\"/>\\n      <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">4e63ea3c-ae8d-4330-b9ca-a6820274322b</guid>\\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 04:52:32 +0000</pubDate>\\n      <description><![CDATA[BTC recently turned lower from the 200-day average, a barometer of long-term trends. CryptoQuant explains why. ]]></description>\\n      <dc:creator>Sam Reynolds</dc:creator>\\n      <content:encoded/>\\n      <dc:description/>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\\\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/\\\">News</category>\\n    </item>\\n    <item>\\n      <title><![CDATA[Polymarket moves to list parlays while SEC seeks public input on prediction market ETFs]]></title>\\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/20/polymarket-moves-to-list-parlays-while-sec-seeks-public-input-on-prediction-market-etfs</link>\\n      <media:content url=\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/8f6faa19ca1f513708bd0f857d706f5cab860b8f-4435x2495.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\\\" type=\\\"image/*\\\" medium=\\\"image\\\"/>\\n      <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">cfc262ee-35b6-4731-b6ad-443cd0213216</guid>\\n      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 22:55:53 +0000</pubDate>\\n      <description><![CDATA[The \\\"combinatorial outcome contracts\\\" would resolve if every part of an underlying contract resolved, according to a filing. ]]></description>\\n      <dc:creator>Nikhilesh De</dc:creator>\\n      <content:encoded/>\\n      <dc:description/>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\\\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Polymarket]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/\\\">News</category>\\n    </item>\\n    <item>\\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin miners tied to AI rise as Nvidia posts big earnings beat and strong outlook]]></title>\\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/20/bitcoin-miners-rise-as-nvidia-posts-blowout-earnings-and-strong-outlook</link>\\n      <media:content url=\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/6fdec8ec82f015c92ad42adb9f14635c3eda7574-1500x1000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\\\" type=\\\"image/*\\\" medium=\\\"image\\\"/>\\n      <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">0a2e0a13-27d6-4153-b688-b6daa6f7528f</guid>\\n      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 22:22:52 +0000</pubDate>\\n      <description><![CDATA[Nvidia's stronger-than-expected results and bullish AI outlook lifted crypto mining stocks tied to data center and high-performance computing demand, even as the chipmaker's shares fell due to growth concerns. ]]></description>\\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\\n      <content:encoded/>\\n      <dc:description/>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\\\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Earnings]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Artificial Intelligence]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/\\\">News</category>\\n    </item>\\n    <item>\\n      <title><![CDATA[Federal Reserve proposes limited master accounts long pursued by crypto firms]]></title>\\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/20/federal-reserve-proposes-limited-master-accounts-long-pursued-by-crypto-firms</link>\\n      <media:content url=\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/f4f2ce69f44063eab06640e7860c845d8dc23861-4712x3045.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\\\" type=\\\"image/*\\\" medium=\\\"image\\\"/>\\n      <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">7d55b311-c84a-4590-8467-2e7fd5994d3b</guid>\\n      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 22:11:10 +0000</pubDate>\\n      <description><![CDATA[The U.S. Fed issued a revised proposal on the structure of payment accounts, taking the next step to build on an earlier pitch for so-called skinny accounts.]]></description>\\n      <dc:creator>Jesse Hamilton</dc:creator>\\n      <content:encoded/>\\n      <dc:description/>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\\\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"tag\\\"><![CDATA[Federal Reserve]]></category>\\n      <category domain=\\\"https://www.coindesk.com/\\\">News</category>\\n    </item>\\n    <item>\\n      <title><![CDATA[Elon Musk's SpaceX held 18,712 bitcoin at fair value of $1.29 billion at end of Q1, IPO filing shows]]></title>\\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/20/elon-musk-s-spacex-holds-18-712-bitcoin-at-fair-value-of-usd1-29-billion-ipo-filing-shows</link>\\n      <media:content url=\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/829f1743cf0300abace5630b27f419489de76efb-7183x4788.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\\\" type=\\\"image/*\\\" medium=\\\"image\\\"/>\\n      <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">80dca635-4922-45f3-8420-f52b1a385aea</guid>\\n      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 21:32:50 +0000</pubDate>\\n  